#====================================================================

# ═══ Layer 0: 错误面 (Error Surface) ═══
# trigger_tool: 出错的工具 (configure/cmake/meson/make/gcc/clang/ld/python/pip/install/test/runtime)
# phase:         出错阶段 (configuration/compilation/linking/installation/testing/runtime)
# error_signature: 正则表达式(|分隔), 用于精确匹配日志文本
id:                     E1555
trigger_tool: conan|meson
phase: configuration
error_signature: meson: inaccessible or not found|Required .* executable unavailable

# ═══ Layer 1: 识别层 (Recognition) ═══
# severity:      3=🔴blocking  2=🟡medium  1=🟢minor  0=✅resolved
# category:      分类标签（受控词表 64 词，逗号分隔，最多 5 个；add/promote 自动归一化）
# prescan_pattern: （可选）预编译源码扫描正则——写入后 PreScanner 运行时自动派生
#                   PSCAN-KB-{id} 规则，无需改 pre-scan-rules.yaml（知识增长即扫描能力增长）
# prescan_globs:   （可选）扫描范围 glob 列表，默认 '*.c, *.h, *.cc, *.cpp, *.sh, Makefile*, *.mk'
# 词表: platform, compat, limitation, detection, hmdfs, ohos, selinux, kernel, portability, libc, musl, posix, syscall, headers, threading, socket, network, build-system, cmake, autotools ...（全表见 scripts/ohc/kb_taxonomy.py）
# match_keywords: 纯文本关键词(逗号分隔), 用于粗筛(固定字符串匹配F)
# title:         简短标题(一句话描述错误模式)
severity:               2
category:               build-system, toolchain, conan
match_keywords: VirtualBuildEnv, auto_generate, virtualbuildenv, vars, apply, tool_requires, conanbuild, automatic generation
title: VirtualBuildEnv introspection can disable automatic tool-require environment generation

# ═══ Layer 2: 诊断层 (Diagnosis) ═══
# root_cause:       一句话根因描述(逗号可分行)
# affected_scope:   影响范围
# verification_cmd: 验证诊断是否正确的命令
root_cause: Conan VirtualBuildEnv constructor defaults auto_generate=False and immediately disables conanfile.virtualbuildenv. A temporary vars().apply() used only for tool-path introspection can therefore suppress the later automatic buildenv generation, even after a toolchain requested it. Installed tool packages are present but disappear from self.run PATH.
affected_scope: Conan 2 recipes using implicit build environments and temporary VirtualBuildEnv introspection in generate() or helper methods; not missing tool packages or ordinary PATH override ordering.
verification_cmd: Inspect constructor flag changes; inspect generated conanbuild script; run native conan create with the same declared tool dependencies.

# ═══ Layer 3: 方案层 (Solution Space) ★ ═══
# 推荐方案 (priority 越小越优先, 从 1 开始)
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: preserve-automatic-buildenv-generation
rec_description: Use VirtualBuildEnv(self, auto_generate=True) at every temporary introspection call. Alternatively generate the build environment explicitly once. Require genuine existing declared tools; do not replace tool_requires with ambient tools. auto_generate=True does not restore an already-disabled flag.
rec_command: with VirtualBuildEnv(self, auto_generate=True).vars().apply():
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: manual

# 回退方案 (当推荐方案不可用时尝试)
fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:
fallback_description:
fallback_command:
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl:

# ★ 禁止策略 (与推荐方案同等重要) ★
# forbid_N_pattern:     正则(|分隔), 匹配则拒绝/警告
# forbid_N_reason:      为什么禁止
# forbid_N_consequence: 违反后的后果
forbid_1_pattern: Hardcode ambient PATH or remove tool_requires to hide a lost generated environment
forbid_1_reason: This substitutes undeclared tools instead of repairing the constructor lifecycle.
forbid_1_consequence: Worker-dependent versions and lost module/resource paths.
# forbid_2_pattern:
# forbid_2_reason:
# forbid_2_consequence:

# ═══ Layer 4: 原则引用 ═══
# principles:    适用的原则 ID 列表(逗号分隔), 在 graph/principles.kv 中定义
principles:

# ═══ 关系图 (Relations) ═══
# causes:          本模式是这些模式的根因 (修好本模式可能同时解决它们)
# caused_by:       本模式的根因是这些模式 (应先修它们)
# similar_to:      特征相似可能混淆的模式
# conflicts_with:  解决方案互相冲突的模式
# prerequisite_of: 本模式是修复这些模式的前置条件
# ═══ 元数据 ═══
forbid_2_pattern: Assume a later auto_generate=True call reenables a previously disabled virtualbuildenv flag
forbid_2_reason: The constructor preserves state when True; it does not explicitly assign True.
forbid_2_consequence: The automatic generation remains disabled unless all offending calls are removed or generation is explicit.
